11-09T01:09:48.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "巴西总统卢拉在赢得第四个任期后的首次电视讲话中承诺维护公共财政，同时不放弃社会项目，意在安抚投资者。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Berkshire Hathaway Plans First Japan Bond Offering Since April", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-09/berkshire-hathaway-plans-first-japan-bond-offering-since-april", "excerpt": "Berkshire Hathaway Inc. has hired banks for its first yen bond sale since April, according to people familiar with the matter, as it prepares to raise more funds in Japan.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T01:04:30.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "知情人士称，伯克希尔·哈撒韦已聘请银行安排自4月以来首次日元债券发行，准备在日本进一步筹资。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 9", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-9", "excerpt": "Oil extended its biggest weekly drop since April 2020 as traders weighed diplomatic efforts to end the US-Iran conflict against fresh attacks in the region.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T23:03:27.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "油价延续自2020年4月以来最大单周跌幅，交易员在权衡结束美伊冲突的外交努力与该地区新发生的袭击。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Sudden Distress at Top-Rated Firm Tests China’s Rating Crackdown", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/sudden-distress-at-top-rated-firm-tests-china-s-rating-crackdown", "excerpt": "Less than six months ago, China’s central bank made its biggest push yet to tackle inflated credit ratings in the nation’s $5.6 trillion corporate debt market. Now it has a live test case.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T23:52:21.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "中国央行不到六个月前针对5.6万亿美元公司债市场的虚高信用评级采取迄今最大力度整治，如今一家高评级公司突发困境，成为检验该行动的实际案例。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Gold Holds Decline as US Jobs Data Fan December Rate Hike Bets", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/gold-holds-decline-as-us-jobs-data-fan-december-rate-hike-bets", "excerpt": "Gold held a late-week retreat after strong US jobs data reinforced expectations the Federal Reserve will seek to raise interest rates to combat inflation.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T23:40:10.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "强劲的美国就业数据强化了市场对美联储将通过加息对抗通胀的预期，金价维持上周末段的回落走势。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Nvidia Probes Huang Affair Amid Spying Controversy", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-08/nvidia-probes-huang-affair-amid-spying-controversy-video", "excerpt": "Nvidia Corp. Chief Executive Officer Jensen Huang says he is cooperating fully with an independent board investigation after admitting to an extramarital relationship. The inquiry follows US intelligence suspicions that a female executive was recruited by a Chinese intelligence agency. (Source: Bloo", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T23:22:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "英伟达CEO黄仁勋承认婚外情，并表示正全面配合独立董事会的调查。此前美国情报部门怀疑一名女高管被中国情报机构招募。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Australia Regulator Halts Private Credit Fund on Bathla Risks", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/australia-regulator-halts-private-credit-fund-on-bathla-risks", "excerpt": "Australia’s regulator stopped Angas Securities Ltd. from selling two managed investment schemes, the latest in a slew of actions to prevent private credit funds offering products that don’t adequately highlight potential risks.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T22:57:45.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "澳大利亚监管机构禁止Angas Securities Ltd.销售两只管理投资计划，这是其一系列行动的最新一例，旨在阻止私募信贷基金提供未充分揭示潜在风险的产品。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "New Zealand Dollar Advances as Ruling Party Gets Election Edge", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/new-zealand-dollar-advances-as-ruling-party-gets-election-edge", "excerpt": "New Zealand’s dollar edged higher in early trading after the incumbent National Party emerged from the weekend election with a path back to power, putting it in pole position to lead negotiations with minor parties.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T22:07:45.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "新西兰元早盘小幅走高，此前执政的国家党在周末选举中获得重新执政的路径，处于与少数党派谈判的领先位置。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Treasury Rally Gets New Boost as Election Hammers the AI Trade", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-08/treasury-rally-gets-new-boost-as-election-hammers-the-ai-trade", "excerpt": "Wall Street sees the Treasury market emerging as a winner from the Democratic landslide in the US midterm elections, giving traders another reason to rethink this year’s sharp selloff.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T20:00:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}], "overview": "科技领域，OpenAI与Hacktron合作排查系统漏洞并推出湿实验室科学AI基准，英伟达发布Cosmos 3世界模拟模型，DeepSeek Harness插件生态持续扩展。财经方面，英伟达CEO黄仁勋承认婚外情，公司启动独立调查，事件涉及疑似中国间谍关系引发安全审查；巴西总统卢拉胜选后首次讲话承诺财政责任；伯克希尔哈撒韦计划在日本发行日元债券。时政领域，华为在纽约面临窃取技术和规避制裁的审判，加沙地带停火谈判与伊拉克库尔德地区无人机袭击事件持续发酵，法国第四周周末示威人数下降。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股方面，SPY 与 QQQ 分别较 sma20 低约 3.7% 与 7.3%，RSI 仅 35.1 与 31.4，5 日跌幅 -2.7% 与 -4.98%，QQQ 距 52 周高点 -13.99%，指数层面偏弱；但个股分化，AAPL、MSFT 维持多头排列，NVDA RSI 30.8 超跌后单日反弹 2.78%，GOOGL 则触发死叉并进入超卖。加密板块整体承压，BTC 现价 75234.37 低于 sma20(78999.42)，RSI 36.9，ETH 单日 -4.1%、距高点 -41.34%，SOL RSI 28.6 超卖，配合恐慌贪婪指数 29 的「恐慌」读数与总市值 24 小时 -4.74%、BTC 主导率 60.2%，技术面呈弱势整理。中概股是少有的亮点，JD 5 日 +13.36% 且 RSI 72 超买，BABA +11.64%、PDD +5.62%、腾讯 +8.06%，多只录得 MACD 金叉，动量明显回暖。商品外汇与宏观方面，黄金 MACD 金叉但仍空头排列，WTI 原油跌破 sma20(97.85) 且 5 日 -6.19%，美元指数站上各均线呈多头排列并接近 52 周高，VIX 单日 -9.01% 但 5 日 +32.03%、RSI 63.2，波动率仍处抬升状态，10Y 收益率 4.86 低于 sma20(5.03)、RSI 36.9 偏弱。整体看，权益与加密技术面偏防御，中概独立走强，宏观波动率与美元偏强构成背景压力。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "JD", "display_name": "京东 (JD)", "stance": "偏上行", "rationale": "JD 现价 29.11，位于 sma20(26.56) 与 sma50(26.88) 上方，5 日涨幅达 13.36%，动量强劲。MACD 为 0.244，已上穿信号线 -0.1586 形成金叉，红柱扩张。但 RSI14 高达 72，已进入超买区间，短线存在过热迹象，技术面呈现强动量与超买并存的状态。"}, {"symbol": "GOOGL", "display_name": "Alphabet", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "GOOGL 现价 284.78，明显低于 sma20(317.44)、sma50(332.93) 与 sma200(339.51)，呈空头排列。RSI14 仅 29.9，处于超卖状态，MACD -16.5773 深于信号线 -12.7862，绿柱扩大，且已触发 SMA50 下穿 SMA200 的死叉，距离 52 周高点 -30.31%，弱势特征最完整。"}, {"symbol": "SOL-USD", "display_name": "Solana", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "SOL 现价 87.98，低于 sma20(97.3) 与 sma50(107.24)，距 52 周高点 -48.73%，处于深度回撤区间。RSI14 为 28.6，已进入超卖，MACD -4.7563 低于信号线 -4.1389，绿柱延续。5 日跌幅 5.32%，与加密总市值 24 小时 -4.74%、恐慌贪婪指数 29 的恐慌氛围一致。"}, {"symbol": "BABA", "display_name": "阿里巴巴 (BABA)", "stance": "偏上行", "rationale": "BABA 现价 109.45，站上 sma20(104.99)，逼近 sma50(108.29)，5 日涨幅 11.64%，反弹动量突出。MACD -1.2639 已上穿信号线 -2.2326 形成金叉，绿柱收敛转正，RSI14 回升至 57.7 的中性偏强区域。距离 52 周高点仍达 -39.56%，属超跌后的技术性修复形态。"}, {"symbol": "GC=F", "display_name": "黄金期货", "stance": "中性", "rationale": "黄金现价 4131.4，介于 sma20(4077.75) 之上、sma50(4222.45) 之下，5 日上涨 4.08%，RSI14 为 51.5 居中。MACD -43.2239 已上穿信号线 -60.8822 形成金叉，但整体仍处负值区，且均线呈空头排列（sma20<sma50<sma200），多空信号相互抵消，技术状态方向不明。"}], "risk_caveat": "本报告仅为基于公开价格与均线、RSI、MACD 等指标读数的客观技术状态描述，不构成任何投资建议或买卖依据。过去走势不代表未来表现，指标信号可能滞后或失效，请读者独立判断并自行承担风险，仅供技术指标解读参考。", "tickers": [{"symbol": "SPY", "displayName": "S&P 500 ETF", "group": "us-equity", "currency": "USD", "exchangeName": "PCX", "currentPrice": 735.29, "pct1Day": 0.31241473396998143, "pct5Day": -2.703378433167104, "pct52WeekHigh": -5.927432767841156, "pct52WeekLow": 16.846236969234678, "sma20": 763.3634887695313, "sma50": 765.679794921875, "sma200": 730.382548828125, "rsi14": 35.10840084624955, "macd": -6.076201604692983, "macdSignal": -2.6522033107963305, "macdHistogram": -3.4239982938966524, "trend": "neutral", "rsiState": "normal", "signals": []}, {"symbol": "QQQ", "displayName": "Nasdaq 100 ETF", "group": "us-equity", "currency": "USD", "exchangeName": "NGM", "currentPrice": 656.1, "pct1Day": 1.3986573491640233, "pct5Day": -4.98